sangati logarithm

  "vibhajana-swarupa e-yukta inverse-abheda"
  "vriddhi-kshaya-kriya ghana-rahita-phala samikarana-yukta"
  "number-yukta expression-yukta domain-math-sthita"
  "avrti-drishthanta vibhajana-drishthanta"
  "O-nlogn-yukta sort-siddha"

